[{"sha":"99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","node_id":"C_kwDOPm8esNoAKDk5ZDYyOTVhMjM0NDRiZjhjYmNlNWNkYTY4MDUxZGM1OWEzZmYyZDE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Runonthespot","email":"mike.renwick@gmail.com","date":"2025-09-13T14:25:49Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2025-09-13T14:25:49Z"},"message":"Fix/add command argument parsing (#44)\n\n* fix: resolve --add command argument parsing issue\n\nWhen using `ck --add /path/to/file`, the file path was incorrectly\nparsed as the pattern argument instead of being recognized as the\nfile to add. This fix ensures that --add properly handles file paths\nwhether provided as the first positional argument (pattern) or in the\nfiles array.\n\nAdded comprehensive integration tests to prevent regression.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: handle empty regex pattern correctly to match grep/ripgrep behavior\n\nEmpty patterns were matching at every position in a line, causing massive\nduplication in output. Now matches each line exactly once, consistent with\nhow grep and ripgrep handle empty patterns.\n\nAlso updated UNEXPECTED.md with discovered issues during AX testing.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: bump version to 0.4.4\n\nUpdated CHANGELOG.md with fixes for --add argument parsing and empty\npattern behavior. Updated all crate versions and PRD.txt version reference.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d469f5ed13546f947ffee18c48e569d333be301","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/git/trees/5d469f5ed13546f947ffee18c48e569d333be301"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/git/commits/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoxX7tCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA05QQABodgWIjgJM4rpeksoAL2d/2\ny8QmaGyqky9akz3Y81QBAzwbgevHUCddmRXlFfEQMSX0jQ0o4LDrr0UF3q+Mc4Ep\nA/JofHARGtsRTWpsr5RUDuuheqZDEbzGRdT0YhY4jC1p5yiMVq82kjRlb6Rb5GU2\n7dELVISqO+HJ2aAfg3gLg13S3yRFual7ZgXaJkRnx9CVsH1MezYZ4pyY761uokIl\nFLNLNLC2yfW3u4YxPx8vIC1/E3nOr8ZZTcvL8yu96B4QbYSA6xhfGICRoJjPT2mg\nA8SyZJygIyjY5P16Y6JyOEN8FtXiQJriJ3E6FSJtRn5j3Uxuzt0gcADnc7CSvnNU\nrePCzFVKQt4eR/jLvXZ1tLgYzvzEvmGqPXJSQmyEuJRwJ2vWIQrS0p19+afVJfP+\nfhARJkfZXdwVEcIYu8WfQ7P3cnRu1a6sHSt24f9xGpRcHy9GCbD8QWyb2G9mMLVj\nHkko6P0ohz7Nnrs4ISqNjqooSdNoTkiy9e+8cY5gg6o8xRbq6BAiamuFS0vr67k/\n74z4xS+F4qznmzxK4fePYdbEpScsQw/gUdAJI9A/2NDUJwsKuUSCt7F2m2H/yX2f\nA5wzPqk+Zyk8VS+Mn+FNuZvMye6Yv8c47OfcfyX6XxkwlOd4YjOE3XBWOKqAfiCl\nvZ+N6lWBhodYz+n7r5C6\n=qf41\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 5d469f5ed13546f947ffee18c48e569d333be301\nparent e77e792220f243f8e4c7a4739d5fd5a2098429ca\nauthor Runonthespot <mike.renwick@gmail.com> 1757773549 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1757773549 +0100\n\nFix/add command argument parsing (#44)\n\n* fix: resolve --add command argument parsing issue\n\nWhen using `ck --add /path/to/file`, the file path was incorrectly\nparsed as the pattern argument instead of being recognized as the\nfile to add. This fix ensures that --add properly handles file paths\nwhether provided as the first positional argument (pattern) or in the\nfiles array.\n\nAdded comprehensive integration tests to prevent regression.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: handle empty regex pattern correctly to match grep/ripgrep behavior\n\nEmpty patterns were matching at every position in a line, causing massive\nduplication in output. Now matches each line exactly once, consistent with\nhow grep and ripgrep handle empty patterns.\n\nAlso updated UNEXPECTED.md with discovered issues during AX testing.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: bump version to 0.4.4\n\nUpdated CHANGELOG.md with fixes for --add argument parsing and empty\npattern behavior. Updated all crate versions and PRD.txt version reference.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","verified_at":"2025-09-13T14:25:49Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/commits/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","html_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/commit/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/commits/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/comments","author":{"login":"runonthespot","id":634732,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNDczMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/634732?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot","html_url":"https://github.com/runonthespot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"e77e792220f243f8e4c7a4739d5fd5a2098429ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/commits/e77e792220f243f8e4c7a4739d5fd5a2098429ca","html_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/commit/e77e792220f243f8e4c7a4739d5fd5a2098429ca"}]},{"sha":"e77e792220f243f8e4c7a4739d5fd5a2098429ca","node_id":"C_kwDOPm8esNoAKGU3N2U3OTIyMjBmMjQzZjhlNGM3YTQ3MzlkNWZkNWEyMDk4NDI5Y2E","commit":{"author":{"name":"Runonthespot","email":"mike.renwick@gmail.com","date":"2025-09-13T10:51:53Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2025-09-13T10:51:53Z"},"message":"Feature/enhanced embedding architecture (#43)\n\n* feat: implement enhanced embedding architecture with striding and reranking\n\nThis comprehensive enhancement adds advanced embedding capabilities:\n\n### 🎯 Enhanced Model Support\n- Add Nomic Embed Text V1.5 (8192 tokens, 768 dims)\n- Add Jina Embeddings V2 Base Code (code-optimized)\n- Maintain backward compatibility with BGE models\n- Add model registry with enhanced model configurations\n\n### 🔄 Striding with Overlap\n- Implement automatic striding for chunks exceeding token limits\n- Add configurable overlap (default 1024 tokens, 12.5%)\n- Conservative token estimation with 10% safety buffer\n- Preserve chunk relationships with stride metadata\n\n### 🎯 Reranking Capability\n- Add multiple reranking models (JINA, BGE)\n- Implement cross-encoder reranking for improved relevance\n- Support for multilingual and code-specific reranking","tree":{"sha":"18752fa1dab5f7e4aee7fc55cb67156d0288ab26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/git/trees/18752fa1dab5f7e4aee7fc55cb67156d0288ab26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/git/commits/e77e792220f243f8e4c7a4739d5fd5a2098429ca","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoxUzJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAseoQAKyTivu58DE2l/Q2FcXAoG83\nO7nY+JJ7SoBp+Kg1STckOftjDS5L+nKVfN/dnOBRHp6pzoBPmKcwAMb7FPBRJ2KS\n6kiJ+jiE23aKlzqdAFItQLxsww+BV8yqhV6hRlHf8jX0hdhjLBxn/Vdsi6Kcy/ca\ntKQ3uE9+j+PKPLEu+fvB0bw8qE9vxROe4FjrRlrpWDXwwYFKhC/qIihYXrjYmEOI\n3iiN1+tKscEU+1iIqVQIkzleu17OnuFbe4AgwMung+orQUJHiBbMm3jvkO9+ZTg1\ndTgdNGcw2wJBlQaqNGDydDnOXEge61pBbNcl2BfD/NjUl0z/klBFOMZ/KSfd4sX8\npE5tLOwOByr9KBcKPzO3A8spfuMTDrfiftMDmoeVAvg+xOktnPuOAQl4iLRCKgbN\nJx1OdwR/+jzi6B0tAP+f2NoEKlhqzcdgkPtnonKdBgh7EHf6dpq6VmZGij9oQF4a\nt60SvzQvSSW+mT7UhJzkJ3amT5UjCeNHM7+jGsChnveUy5Q7hVFUpvIkAfbe58BJ\nGrXXfTddegjSwY6UMsY1SiFM44WyiO7YjS35Bhr0vu6DfAQcdJNjR9xsNPyVFjBh\nk+idlD9Y8oEF9kHXa6sQvTskCQaH+NJYw4WNscnOKnZ/zRtBfSOs1GfcX5FaUDBS\nrjo13bO7eDjEvTdJykmt\n=EAgJ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 18752fa1dab5f7e4aee7fc55cb67156d0288ab26\nparent ef8c6407727fe787822b8024eb8d5e6225ee75b0\nauthor Runonthespot <mike.renwick@gmail.com> 1757760713 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1757760713 +0100\n\nFeature/enhanced embedding architecture (#43)\n\n* feat: implement enhanced embedding architecture with striding and reranking\n\nThis comprehensive enhancement adds advanced embedding capabilities:\n\n### 🎯 Enhanced Model Support\n- Add Nomic Embed Text V1.5 (8192 tokens, 768 dims)\n- Add Jina Embeddings V2 Base Code (code-optimized)\n- Maintain backward compatibility with BGE models\n- Add model registry with enhanced model configurations\n\n### 🔄 Striding with Overlap\n- Implement automatic striding for chunks exceeding token limits\n- Add configurable overlap (default 1024 tokens, 12.5%)\n- Conservative token estimation with 10% safety buffer\n- Preserve chunk relationships with stride metadata\n\n### 🎯 Reranking Capability\n- Add multiple reranking models (JINA, BGE)\n- Implement cross-encoder reranking for improved relevance\n- Support for multilingual and code-specific reranking","verified_at":"2025-09-13T10:51:53Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/commits/e77e792220f243f8e4c7a4739d5fd5a2098429ca","html_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/commit/e77e792220f243f8e4c7a4739d5fd5a2098429ca","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/commits/e77e792220f243f8e4c7a4739d5fd5a2098429ca/comments","author":{"login":"runonthespot","id":634732,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNDczMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/634732?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot","html_url":"https://github.com/runonthespot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19